{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拜起胡跪，燒香運想已，合掌唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜，起立歎云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讚歎已，隨意述誠。雖曰禮經，應須禮佛菩薩，使三寶義足。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下去每字準此一唱一拜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拜已，胡跪運想，準常儀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懺悔發願已，歸命禮三寶。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "旋竟，三歸依如常。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0956002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0956002", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】康熙六年刊增上寺報恩藏本"}
